y I'll work on the text throughout the home page and make it something more meaningful ]", "created_at": "2024-05-28T15:20:18Z", "repo": "Dexterity", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5805ba75c1bfd89e1aa6829a33974dd19a73b23a", "message": "Workshopping The Website 1.2.5\n\n- Changed the colours\n- Made the home page more responsive for tablets\n- Removed the form from work with us page\n- Redesigned the work with us page.\n- Reduced the size of images (This should make the site lighter and faster now)\n- Reduced website file size from 11mb to 700kb (Huge leap)\n- Changed the Favicon\n- Made the dextr logo at the top a link\n- I'm hapy with how the site is going : )", "created_at": "2024-05-27T11:51:00Z", "repo": "Dexterity", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7da48c6c969be89852cbd222bc0b9a6fd85bd133", "message": "Workshopping The Website 1.2.4\n\n- Arranged the HTML code\n- Added a new Favicon\n- Changed the Colours", "created_at": "2024-05-26T12:05:32Z", "repo": "Dexterity", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d402b416f4e012180d89c2dd4ef6c2b2b788a0a3", "message": "Workshopping The Website 1.2.3\n\nDidn't  really do much this time\n- Added a favicon\n- Changed the font on the cards\n- Made the colour of the header darker", "created_at": "2024-05-26T08:34:36Z", "repo": "Dexterity", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1d8d56719dfa14aa8e762f06aafc229597247cff", "message": "Workshopping The Website 1.2.2\n\nIn this commit I added some finishing touches to the home page and also changed the colour of the header and few text. I also Created the \"Work with us\" page and the \"Contact us page\" and made the site more responsive.\nwhat's left to do not is the learn with us page majorly and then a few other changes before I round up the site.", "created_at": "2024-05-25T21:38:58Z", "repo": "Dexterity", "